Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时机到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米加托比亚的士兵们啊 看吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地球即将成为我们的囊中之物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要捉住地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们成为我们机器人的奴隶!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先行一步去地球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,负责引导铁人兵团
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不允许失败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你正是为此而制造出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米加托比亚全军将士们!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉地球人的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个玩具而已啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 做得真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正都是小夫的表哥做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他是这方面的天才嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.97,0:02:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很清楚嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 怕了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不老实!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓坏了就说吓坏了嘛!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羡慕了就说羡慕了嘛!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我老实说!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我就是不羡慕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊 能做出更~大的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像房子一样大的机器人呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:32.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此傲慢!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克罗斯 攻击!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛 好痛好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶! 算啥啊算啥啊那玩意!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能会羡慕那小不点机器人!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能走路很了不起了? 会发射导弹很了不起了?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是个大蚊子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好羡慕…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热 离我远点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害的 有这~么大的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:03:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会走的 连导弹都能发射的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种东西 你不已经有了么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很大的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会走的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能发射导弹…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要更帅气的!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要更强大的 要腿更长的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要更巨大的!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要像大楼那样的才行啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:34.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想要好想要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.47,0:03:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想要好想要好想要!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:39.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死啦!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都有了像我这样的机器人了 还这么多废话!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说 你以为那么大的机器人要多少钱啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天气这么热你还在这耍性子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烦死啦烦死啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:03:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去凉快的地方!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你也不需要这种机器人的啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.15,0:05:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这么烦躁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是缺钙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.43,0:05:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南极? 北极?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我错啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然有哆啦A梦 我就将就一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了 在那种地方闹别扭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找~到你啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这种东西会从天上…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下去啦 掉下去啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你在干什么呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 不用担心…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西 到底是什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 刚才那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了! 跟刚才那个不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 请不要介意~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西 难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.14,0:07:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是向某个地方发送信号
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以此来收集零件的装置啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 说了这么多 结果还是在为我着想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷路了 还被北极熊追赶…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:12.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太悲惨了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个这个 是哆啦A梦你给我的吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这啥啊! 你从哪拿来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你给的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西我才不知道呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎? 那到底是谁…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:39.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会有这种东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是它叫来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在北极捡的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定会有零件源源不断地送过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后组成一个巨大的机器人的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 还是还给物主比较好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是物主啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北极的圣诞老人? 北极熊?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…可以交给派出所…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你要怎么说?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「在北极捡到了巨大的机器人」?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的啦! 是神送给我的啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不干不干不干不干
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果物主出现了就还给他好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样 姑且先组装起来吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不? 好不?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果只是组装起来的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 在哪组装好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在院子里不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈会生气的 会说洗好的衣服晾不干
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗衣服这种多余的事情 别做就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为太大了所以才不行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果用「缩小灯」变小了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行! 就是大才好啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊 就算你组装好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西在街上走的话 会给邻居添麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 净说这不行那不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:10:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了! 很久以前我们不是去过镜面世界嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.85,0:10:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟这边的世界一模一样 但是街上一个人都没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说用「相反镜子」?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错没错!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里的话 做什么都不会给别人添麻烦~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊 这东西这么大…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没法穿过镜子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 反正…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我这种人 想要个巨大机器人本来就是个错误…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样别这样 方法也不是没有啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「相反世界进入油」!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.83,0:10:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不是镜子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要往像镜子一样能反射的平面上涂了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能进入那个世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去吧! 马上就去! 立马就去…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过…有能让这个穿过去的宽敞平面吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:54.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「室内钓鱼池」!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是哆啦A梦最可靠啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把油滴在这个水面上…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:14.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成镜子了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是镜面世界啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「轻松手套」!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好轻 好轻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:45.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人都能搬了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰坏周围的东西哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 天花板跑到下方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你转过来不就好了?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等一会 我把窗户拿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都是左右相反的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为是镜子里映照的世界嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 不是什么大问题 不用介意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.51,0:12:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金鱼不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为镜面世界是只有风景的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了我们以外 是没有人和动物的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么宽广的地方只有我们而已?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都可以随心所欲地使用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会延伸到哪里呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到天涯海角
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:13:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟真正的世界一模一样 会一直延伸下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好! 快点把它组装好吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊! 新的部件来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续搬进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:31.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 刚才起就一直咚咚咚的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:33.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是地震吧 真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:35.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再添一碗!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像全部到齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:45.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好! 一口气组装起来吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连接处小心不要错位了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往右一点 反方向反方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胳膊看起来很有力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能举起多少吨的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快完成了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿 我觉得应该是放控制电脑的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎? 没有那种部件了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.53,0:14:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就动不了了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会! 都已经做到这一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好! 干脆就去买来吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:06.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来百货商店也刚好在搞打折
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.37,0:15:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去快回哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 可以坐进去的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只能在电影里看到的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真货啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关…关上了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关上了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 让它动起来试试
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎? 让它动起来啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哪个东西怎么操作…一点头绪都没啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便摆弄一下试试
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以这么不负责任呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:03.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是 就凭你那脑瓜确实做不来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没这种事!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好~! 随便摆弄一下!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动起来了动起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好~!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子…!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的! 前进!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:50.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害! 我操纵它走起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道 其实我是个天才?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 其实是我用这个让它动起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在未来百货商店买的「脑波控制器」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个电脑是用脑电波来控制的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以按照你心中所想那样让机器人动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎?! 那么说刚才全部都是哆啦A梦你…?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那么灰心嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也能马上学会操纵它的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎? 机器人?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正准备去游泳池呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你去个比游泳池有趣得多的地方吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像镜子一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这游泳吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像只大海獭一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人居然能浮在水上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你不也是机器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这使用的合金我从来没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是从哪来的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思议啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:55.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不说这个啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没给它取名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:19:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没什么帅气的名字呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「小海獭」怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小海獭就有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫「山大克罗斯」怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:05.37,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(609.811,657)}圣诞武士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好帅!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是模仿圣诞老人这个词
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为它出生在北极嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 今天起它就叫山大克罗斯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪呢 裘多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉…露…露…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多 那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.15,0:20:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一号 野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上了!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇! 好厉害 好厉害!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像变成奥运选手了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过真是不可思议啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样跑来跑去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我们一点都不会头晕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不会从座位上掉下来呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为无论这机器人朝着哪个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它内部的重力场一直都保持固定的方向的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种事能做到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…以现今地球的科技是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上是不行的? 那这个机器人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说我说 别说这么难的话题了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你也来操纵试试?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.31,0:20:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗? 能做得来吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很简单 很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握住这个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要心里想着跑或者停就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.99,0:21:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭蕾舞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭蕾舞…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.87,0:21:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭蕾舞啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 这个按钮是干什么用的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那个没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个摩天大楼就这么…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一瞬间就变成粉末了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道会变成这样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是静香你的错啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个机器人 原来是不得了的破坏性武器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好刚才那是无人大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.39,0:22:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是在真正的城市里这么大肆破坏的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了! 别说这么恐怖的事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有点不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山大克罗斯还有这个镜面世界 就作为我们三人之间的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是再也别来这边的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 山大克罗斯就…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零件应该已经全部在头脑的引导下送到了北极才对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我连一个碎片都没找着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我依靠与头脑的通信来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是也中断了…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.87,0:23:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我暂时在这附近搜索一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起立 敬礼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.09,0:23:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.39,0:23:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比请留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.71,0:23:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还问我为什么!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.91,0:23:55.51,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}好丢脸~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.43,0:23:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迟到 又忘记做作业 上课打瞌睡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.55,0:24:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我把脑袋冷静一下!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:01.31,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.75,0:24:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师你…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.03,0:24:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能明白 失去了山大克罗斯的我的心情…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是福山雅秋 请听
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《樱花饼》
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:12.34,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a5\fs30}注：原型为福山雅治和《樱花坂道（桜坂）》
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.58,0:24:15.89,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}特别嘉宾竟然在这登场了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.90,0:24:17.66,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}在此之前 有请!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.48,0:24:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么小的房子 不可能藏在这的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.07,0:24:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是抱歉啊 我这房子这么小!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.53,0:24:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 是哥哥吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.28,0:24:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来百货商店把今年的商品目录送来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.94,0:24:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要送去你那?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.11,0:24:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 放你那好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.53,0:24:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们家太狭窄了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是抱歉啊 这儿这么狭窄!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.27,0:24:57.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.85,0:25:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.03,0:25:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罚抄写好没?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 写好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.21,0:25:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.54,0:25:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.33,0:25:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.96,0:25:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经好好反省了吧 可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.27,0:25:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.48,0:25:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.92,0:25:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的山大克罗斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.94,0:25:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:25:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.03,0:25:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小 小夫的机器人是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.23,0:26:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.25,0:26:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.66,0:26:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪了?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.92,0:26:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太慢啦 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.85,0:26:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太慢了哦!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.14,0:26:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂! 把书包还给我…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.91,0:26:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.27,0:26:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的像房子一样的巨大机器人做出来没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.85,0:26:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人? 你…你说啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.22,0:26:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别装傻!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.39,0:26:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过要做的! 别跟我说忘了!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.92,0:26:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.19,0:26:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗我们的?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.52,0:26:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 教训他!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克罗斯飞踢!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.03,0:26:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄不对啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.11,0:26:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.36,0:26:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.83,0:26:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.18,0:26:57.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.74,0:27:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…大雄?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.08,0:27:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…我是大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫莉露露
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.16,0:27:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.25,0:27:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是外国人?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.68,0:27:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「wài guó rén」 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.21,0:27:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.60,0:27:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是不是不太懂日语啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.21,0:27:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我们去你家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.37,0:27:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?! 我家?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.66,0:27:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是无所谓啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.35,0:27:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.21,0:27:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么随便!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.44,0:27:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还找大雄有事呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.06,0:27:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被无视了!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.75,0:27:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克罗斯 Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.36,0:27:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.93,0:27:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿又旧又脏 请忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.26,0:27:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是抱歉啊 又旧又脏!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.82,0:28:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在上面的房间等一会
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.37,0:28:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有更高级点的蛋糕之类的吗? 或者蜜瓜之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.79,0:28:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家只·配·吃这种东西!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.41,0:28:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 你在看什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.59,0:28:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.83,0:28:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机…机器人? 你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.40,0:28:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是大雄对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.46,0:28:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.58,0:28:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道机器人在哪的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.94,0:28:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为 为什么这么说?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.51,0:28:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在找机器人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.94,0:28:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是对我很重要的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.22,0:28:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的机器人?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.94,0:28:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你会有那种恐怖的破坏性武器…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.73,0:28:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.12,0:28:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.95,0:28:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是什么破坏性武器
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.22,0:28:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.45,0:28:52.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行土木工程用的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.49,0:28:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那东西为什么会在北极?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.85,0:28:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你更多了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.98,0:29:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 如果没有那个机器人就麻烦了…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.77,0:29:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我把机器人还给你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.85,0:29:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我不该随便用「备用口袋」的…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.67,0:29:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 跟我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.86,0:29:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信 不用竹蜻蜓也可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.99,0:29:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 你到底是什么人?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从哪来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.27,0:29:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒要问你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.93,0:29:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么擅自把我的机器人搬到这里来?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:43.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没…没啦 那是…呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.08,0:29:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.33,0:29:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.60,0:29:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.83,0:29:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多? 好奇怪的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.95,0:29:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多? 怎么啦 回答我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.50,0:29:54.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的 你又没有操纵它
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.31,0:29:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多是有自我意识 能自由行动的…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.11,0:30:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道 你组装的时候没有把头脑放进去?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.56,0:30:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头脑?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.87,0:30:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个圆圆的球一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.44,0:30:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么一说 好像是有那东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.92,0:30:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 它跑哪去了呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.43,0:30:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪了?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.65,0:30:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 不知道什么时候就不见了…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.44,0:30:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 对不起!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.73,0:30:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为补偿 给你这个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.80,0:30:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「脑波控制器」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要握着然后心里想着 就可以操纵了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.62,0:30:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多 动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.19,0:30:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.26,0:30:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.61,0:30:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧? 能动起来吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.81,0:30:35.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.15,0:30:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 原谅你了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.36,0:30:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 你要跟我约定两件事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.94,0:30:43.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.81,0:30:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.04,0:30:49.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个「室内钓鱼池」暂时借给我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.73,0:30:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.73,0:30:54.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的事情 就作为我们两人间的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:30:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.59,0:31:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是地球 莉露露呼叫总部
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.86,0:31:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到裘多的身体了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.85,0:31:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 头脑下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.61,0:31:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会继续寻找的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.18,0:31:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在找到之前 由我负责操纵和指挥工程
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.59,0:31:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有很大的收获
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.52,0:31:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了一个比北极更大的完全无人的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.02,0:31:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里的话 可以不被地球人发现 进行我们的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.32,0:31:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等待基地的完成 然后出动铁人兵团
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.30,0:31:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米加托比亚 万岁!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.37,0:31:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.08,0:31:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂! 喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.64,0:31:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打棒球咯 打棒球咯!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不让大雄跟我们一起玩~
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.45,0:31:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不一起玩~
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.41,0:31:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你最近不太正常啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.70,0:31:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.10,0:32:01.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体不好吗? 还是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.65,0:32:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.03,0:32:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再添一碗!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:06.06,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 没有胃口吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.63,0:32:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鱼要吃掉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.84,0:32:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起鱼 隔壁的山田先生
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.69,0:32:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像最近开始玩钓鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.01,0:32:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑去附近的钓鱼场 一呆就很久…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.71,0:32:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说什么钓鱼场啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.88,0:32:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这突然怎么啦?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.53,0:32:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 没什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.09,0:32:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到山田先生 他的妻子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.04,0:32:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天早上一边照镜子…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.52,0:32:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说什么镜子啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃饱了!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.65,0:32:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.25,0:32:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.75,0:32:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钓鱼场 镜子…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.67,0:32:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把山大克罗斯还给她 这样真的好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.45,0:32:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底她想做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.91,0:32:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什么在发光
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.56,0:32:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流星?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.16,0:32:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有了!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.63,0:32:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.99,0:32:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在后山那边
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.77,0:33:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪呢 好像是落在这附近的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.89,0:33:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,室内钓鱼池?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.74,0:33:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会在这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.95,0:33:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有…有什么东西被送到镜面世界去了!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.09,0:33:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是流星?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.13,0:33:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么呢 看起来像某种东西的零件…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘! 会被发现的!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.61,0:33:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆…哆啦A梦!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.34,0:33:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为看你样子很奇怪 所以就跟着你过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.49,0:33:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 把一切都坦白吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.59,0:34:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 我知道啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神秘少女 莉露露啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.66,0:34:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定 是外星人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.40,0:34:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我觉得她不是坏人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.41,0:34:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么在发光
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.15,0:34:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送进来的东西 都被聚集在那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.69,0:34:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这是什么啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.64,0:34:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城市的一部分被拆毁了…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.18,0:34:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得像科幻电影里的情景了!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.17,0:34:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊! 那是山大克罗斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.33,0:34:46.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露也在
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.30,0:34:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.60,0:34:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她好像在说什么 不过听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.38,0:34:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.81,0:34:55.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「无线电话」!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:34:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞过去!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.43,0:35:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把完成着陆甲板作为最优先任务
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.61,0:35:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总司令命令我们尽快完成
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.98,0:35:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵团已经做好出发的准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.58,0:35:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的 只是等待这个基地的完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.60,0:35:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个基地 对于在地球上的作战而言
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.18,0:35:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是作为我们的据点的重要之地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.02,0:35:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要尽一切力量完成
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.43,0:35:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并以此 把成功带给…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的捕捉地球人行动!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.21,0:35:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉地球人行动?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.78,0:35:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.97,0:35:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.74,0:35:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来了啊 正好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.47,0:35:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正想把你带来这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.71,0:35:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想把镜面世界的出入口扩大
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.12,0:35:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为大兵团的到来做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.80,0:35:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.43,0:35:48.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.39,0:35:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人之中 我只会给你一个人特别优待
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.10,0:35:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来吧  大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.50,0:35:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.07,0:35:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.34,0:36:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.48,0:36:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.79,0:36:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.70,0:36:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「空气炮」!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.56,0:36:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砰!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.76,0:36:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山大克罗斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.44,0:36:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.57,0:36:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是出口啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.30,0:36:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.13,0:37:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气炮!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.42,0:37:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砰!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.05,0:37:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他们跑了! 把它撑破!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.83,0:37:19.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做出一个更大的连接两个世界的口子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.60,0:37:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要撑破了啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.27,0:37:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别做傻事! 这样太乱来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.88,0:37:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能用蛮力插进去…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.74,0:37:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.06,0:37:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.74,0:37:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.96,0:37:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的爆炸是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.19,0:38:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是次元震
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.08,0:38:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她想强行撬开口子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.93,0:38:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果导致空间的连接点扭曲 然后断裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对面的世界里 出入口肯定也被塞住了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.43,0:38:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 那些可怕的机器人就再也出不来了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.38,0:38:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.41,0:38:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 莉露露也…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.88,0:38:44.51,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}喂! 给我安静点!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.29,0:38:47.04,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}哎呀 可恶…!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.62,0:38:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吵啊 真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.58,0:38:49.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这声音是!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.18,0:38:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.64,0:38:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说你给我站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.31,0:38:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂! 我都说了…! 可恶…!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.81,0:38:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.65,0:39:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了…啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.03,0:39:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气死我了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.16,0:39:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它好像想说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.26,0:39:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.10,0:39:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「翻译蒟蒻」!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.36,0:39:11.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好冷!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.55,0:39:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂! 居然敢对我这么狠!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把身体还给我! 你把我身体弄哪去了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.88,0:39:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的身体还有同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.68,0:39:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经被我们关在镜面世界里 再也出不来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.22,0:39:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.17,0:39:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.56,0:39:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联络不上…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.80,0:39:31.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜面世界已经被堵上了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们再也无法征服世界了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.77,0:39:41.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人类 无论你们再怎么挣扎也晚了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.77,0:39:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.81,0:39:45.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在刚才 我跟米加托比亚星联系上了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.10,0:39:48.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人兵团等不及基地建成
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.69,0:39:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经全军向地球出发了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.03,0:39:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们不断地进行空间跃迁 马上就会到达地球了!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.76,0:39:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 怕了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.14,0:40:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟…糟糕了!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.32,0:40:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人大军
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.24,0:40:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要征服地球
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.32,0:40:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉行动!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.31,0:40:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一片悲鸣!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.26,0:40:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可大意!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.14,0:40:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满汉全席!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.26,0:40:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻来滚去!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.30,0:40:11.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新陈代谢!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.94,0:40:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前就有点担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.07,0:40:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是电视和漫画看太多了…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.01,0:40:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的啊 警察先生!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.06,0:40:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从外星来的机器人…!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.41,0:40:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.73,0:40:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挂了!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.35,0:40:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想到谁就打给谁吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.04,0:40:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自卫队! 总理大臣! 警视厅!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.21,0:40:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特命系!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.21,0:40:30.19,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a5\fs30}警视厅所属的部门之一，\N更为人所知的是日剧《搭档》中的特命系
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.09,0:40:34.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人相信我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.95,0:40:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在我们做这些的时候 铁人兵团已经冲着地球来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.41,0:40:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要去跟「那两人」…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.86,0:40:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,商量一下呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.69,0:40:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会相信我们吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.12,0:40:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人兵团?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.72,0:40:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀过来了?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.96,0:40:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 不好了 不好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.35,0:40:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们相信了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.75,0:40:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是我们的好朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.77,0:41:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.20,0:41:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只靠我们四个人能保护地球吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.51,0:41:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 要是没有其他同伴的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.89,0:41:09.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.31,0:41:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让那个山大克罗斯的头脑成为我们的同伴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.87,0:41:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 说不定还能打听出敌人的情报呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.52,0:41:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.37,0:41:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样才能让那个叫头脑的家伙成为我们的同伴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.73,0:41:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西 把它改造了不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.20,0:41:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改造它就太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.38,0:41:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟它好好谈谈 说不定它就能理解呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.79,0:41:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那么先谈谈看
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.08,0:41:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来来 请坐好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.55,0:41:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「翻译蒟蒻」!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.83,0:41:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好冷!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.16,0:41:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂! 居然敢用草绳绑着我!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.10,0:41:50.92,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}铁人兵团来到以后 你们这些家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.55,0:41:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来来 先冷静一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.75,0:41:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定会被打得晕头转向 鼻青脸肿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.21,0:41:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落花流水 满地找牙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.43,0:41:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不省人事…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.55,0:42:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能乱动啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.06,0:42:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人啊 你们命中注定要成为我们的奴隶!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.79,0:42:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这种家伙 肯定被教训得体无完肤…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.64,0:42:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都说了…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.32,0:42:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把你们地球人 千刀万剐 千刀万剐!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.84,0:42:13.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永不超生…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.87,0:42:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渣都没…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.65,0:42:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渣都…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.43,0:42:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了让你老实点!!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.91,0:42:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么有这么混蛋的家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.59,0:42:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说 光从外表看你就跟个傻瓜一样!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.47,0:42:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟这种保龄球怎么可能谈得来啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是拿它没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.73,0:42:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「对话箱子」!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.23,0:42:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把东西放到这个里面
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.46,0:42:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论是什么的外表都会得亲和
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.26,0:42:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以变得能自由说话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.08,0:42:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊 早点拿出来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.57,0:42:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要干什么!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.42,0:42:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开关 启动!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.16,0:43:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.20,0:43:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在挥着小手呢~
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.33,0:43:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也可爱过头了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.93,0:43:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像只小鸟一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.41,0:43:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫它小小鸟吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.54,0:43:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫小小鸟有点太单调了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.72,0:43:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.78,0:43:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为它「皮皮皮」「波波波」地叫
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.82,0:43:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫它皮波吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.46,0:43:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么破烂名字
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.50,0:43:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人的品位真是糟糕透了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.25,0:43:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.27,0:43:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们别给我安什么怪名字比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.73,0:43:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫裘多
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.66,0:44:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.42,0:44:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘…裘多这个名字给人感觉太严肃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.81,0:44:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你嘛 像这样叫「皮波」的话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.42,0:44:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就能让人觉得比较可爱嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.35,0:44:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这品位无药可救了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.16,0:44:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要理解低能的地球人的审美观真是太难了比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.01,0:44:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正 就是奴隶说的话而已嘛比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.69,0:44:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然样子是变得可爱了 想法却丁点没变…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.17,0:44:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为性格是无法改变的嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.74,0:44:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类真是没用的生物啊比哟~
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:31.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这么可爱的样子里说出这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.32,0:44:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更让人觉得火大啊 这混帐
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.47,0:44:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要要…要冷静地对话 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.70,0:44:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊! 听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.32,0:44:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类和机器人是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.35,0:44:45.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得把人类当成奴隶是不好的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人类这种比机器人要低等的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.04,0:44:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做奴隶是理所当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.85,0:44:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没这种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.17,0:44:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其大雄你是最蠢最无可救药的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.42,0:44:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.61,0:44:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再给我说一遍试试!!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.97,0:44:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐…!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.85,0:45:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.78,0:45:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我到外边玩去!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.14,0:45:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那个凶暴的地球人是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.06,0:45:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个叫做「妈妈」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:18.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是地球上最强的生物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.15,0:45:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 在继续谈话之前!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.13,0:45:32.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来听听本大爷的歌 刚才的争吵就一笔勾销了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.89,0:45:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,标题是「盛夏的爱之梦」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.61,0:45:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖胖胖胖! 胖虎!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.37,0:45:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老子叫胖虎!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.80,0:45:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级巨星加孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.31,0:45:53.29,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}歌唱得巨好听…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.05,0:45:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从…从…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.24,0:45:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来没听过这么烂的歌啊比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.24,0:45:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…说啥…!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.19,0:46:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太烂了比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.34,0:46:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是巨吵无比的噪音公害啊比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.68,0:46:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真敢说啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.65,0:46:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本就不懂什么叫歌!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.14,0:46:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.64,0:46:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我唱的歌比你好听多了比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.60,0:46:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很…很…很好啊! 你唱来听听啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就唱
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.63,0:46:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是唱得比我烂我就把你拿去烧烤了!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.82,0:47:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊 皮波
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.56,0:47:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓了一跳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.12,0:47:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不服气 不过是唱得好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.21,0:47:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没…没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.06,0:47:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…是不错
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.27,0:47:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前是职业歌手吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.99,0:47:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.42,0:47:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么? 你明明唱得这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.32,0:47:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米加托比亚星上 只有贵族能唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.64,0:47:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们劳动机器人是不允许唱歌的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.95,0:47:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是个劳动机器人!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.87,0:47:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有权利唱歌!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.71,0:47:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙也快不行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.58,0:47:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以扔垃圾桶了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.16,0:48:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉…露露…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.84,0:48:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太过分了!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.64,0:48:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌要是不能随心所欲地唱 就不是歌了!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.95,0:48:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太浪费了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.08,0:48:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是听了你唱的歌  大家肯定会很高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.33,0:48:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但…但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.03,0:48:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都把劳动机器人当成垃圾一样看待…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.97,0:48:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这没有这种歧视啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.15,0:48:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你可以随便唱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.30,0:48:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你啊! 明明是个机器人 为什么要跟人类在一起啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.99,0:48:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.25,0:48:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟是人类还是机器人无关
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.61,0:48:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错! 因为我们是朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.18,0:48:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.57,0:48:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉 心里怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.26,0:48:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟这群人在一起 我会变得奇怪的比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.72,0:48:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这是在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.67,0:49:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何 一定要去帮莉露露的忙才行
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.99,0:49:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.19,0:49:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我错了! 我会做大家的同伴的!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.18,0:49:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这突然是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.05,0:49:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你理解了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.11,0:49:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都说啦 只要好好谈谈它就能理解的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.52,0:49:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的歌浸润了它的心灵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.80,0:49:19.20,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}没可能的事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.20,0:49:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好开心啊 皮波
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.96,0:49:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天开始 你就是我们的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.62,0:49:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如…如果我能回到身体里 就能助大家一臂之力了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.57,0:49:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的身体在哪呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.47,0:49:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊! 要是交给皮波来操纵的话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.23,0:49:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能让山大克罗斯成为我们的同伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.17,0:49:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就能以一敌百了!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.92,0:49:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好! 那我们就去那个镜面世界吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.29,0:49:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我们没了「室内钓鱼池」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.21,0:49:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要在哪找又大又像镜子一样的平面呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.75,0:49:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.65,0:49:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锵! 静香家的浴室!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.97,0:49:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我晕!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.63,0:49:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 不跟静香打个招呼吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.91,0:50:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想把女孩子牵扯到这么可怕的事情里来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.02,0:50:04.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们走!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.50,0:50:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是左右颠倒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.65,0:50:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然完全理解不了…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.98,0:50:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之好厉害啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.65,0:50:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门牌也是反的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.65,0:50:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.56,0:50:23.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联系不上…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.57,0:50:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.62,0:50:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么有趣的世界 你想一个人独占啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.08,0:50:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.89,0:50:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 皮波?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.49,0:50:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要来到这边的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.96,0:50:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就没有利用价值了比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.15,0:50:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙 骗了我们啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.50,0:50:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.64,0:50:41.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.18,0:50:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.47,0:50:46.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上当的地球人真是傻瓜啊比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.63,0:50:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.72,0:50:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不会被地球人抓住呢比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.72,0:50:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐…!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.60,0:50:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.38,0:50:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.65,0:51:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开火! 我是裘多啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.48,0:51:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是裘多的头脑!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.29,0:51:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟裘多头脑的形状不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.93,0:51:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮…皮波!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.06,0:51:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气炮 砰!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.44,0:51:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砰!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.84,0:51:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.61,0:51:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别…别误会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.61,0:51:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是你刚好在我摔倒的方向上而已啦! 哼!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.26,0:51:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快逃啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.00,0:51:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.36,0:51:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别杀了! 人类要捉活的!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.73,0:52:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捉住五个了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.66,0:52:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个就消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.08,0:52:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.67,0:52:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.57,0:52:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.28,0:52:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.02,0:52:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.08,0:52:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消灭了两个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.02,0:52:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.27,0:52:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们带到基地去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.66,0:52:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定还有其他的人类在
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.10,0:52:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派基地的人到附近侦查
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.21,0:52:46.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.13,0:52:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃够苦头了…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.10,0:53:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都被带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.14,0:53:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办 要想点办法救他们才行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.34,0:53:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好不容易才得救 别再故意去冒险了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.68,0:53:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么行! 你说让我抛弃他们吗!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.35,0:53:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去救他们有什么意义呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.61,0:53:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样做…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.93,0:53:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是没什么意义!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.46,0:53:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是我的朋友 我必须去救他们!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.96,0:53:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.97,0:53:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想点办法救他们才行…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.85,0:53:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.45,0:53:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会救你的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.15,0:53:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你也可以啦…比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.69,0:53:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别误会了!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.16,0:53:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说你是碰巧帮了我 但我还是要还这个人情
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.69,0:53:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.95,0:54:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真…真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.19,0:54:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.81,0:54:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.79,0:54:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水差不多该烧好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.23,0:54:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.38,0:54:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜面世界!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.79,0:54:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边抓紧点!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.50,0:54:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.27,0:54:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种家伙 扔到垃圾箱里就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.50,0:54:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有命令让我们挖出来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.10,0:54:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用的 都已经动不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.47,0:54:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙就是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.50,0:54:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对! 我才不是什么垃圾!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.09,0:55:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.52,0:55:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.92,0:55:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 只听从莉露露一个人的比哟!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.91,0:55:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.66,0:55:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.12,0:55:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.48,0:55:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.86,0:55:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘…裘多突然开始大肆破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.24,0:55:27.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.32,0:55:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.64,0:55:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.72,0:55:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.66,0:55:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.74,0:55:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还活着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.11,0:55:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还以为你死了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.44,0:55:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波操纵着山大克罗斯 吸引了它们的注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.13,0:55:47.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波它?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.98,0:55:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.66,0:55:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人看守了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.21,0:55:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「穿透环」!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.83,0:55:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.35,0:55:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.38,0:55:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.80,0:56:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然违反约定跑来这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.32,0:56:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是发生了什么事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.38,0:56:09.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.46,0:56:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说裘多在后山大肆破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.56,0:56:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟刚才那些人类有关吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.24,0:56:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.14,0:56:20.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.59,0:56:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.15,0:56:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 山大克罗斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.25,0:56:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.42,0:56:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是山大克罗斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.83,0:56:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是什么山大克罗斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.04,0:56:45.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫裘多!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.95,0:56:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欠你的也还了比哟
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.64,0:56:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不会帮助地球人了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.89,0:56:52.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去找莉露露
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.73,0:56:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙还是让人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.50,0:56:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波 等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.51,0:57:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管它啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.39,0:57:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.84,0:57:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.74,0:57:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「缩小灯」!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.06,0:57:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底 发生什么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.34,0:57:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类好像已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.47,0:57:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去追踪裘多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.72,0:57:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.45,0:57:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.18,0:57:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有…有人被埋在下面了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.63,0:57:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.98,0:57:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.97,0:57:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这人…是之前那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.18,0:58:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.54,0:58:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.60,0:58:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露她 一定能认出我的!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.32,0:58:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.04,0:58:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个机器人都没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.63,0:58:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为它们被派出去侦查了 不久就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.14,0:58:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.61,0:58:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 回答我!  这里是总部
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.38,0:58:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.40,0:58:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.54,0:58:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵团已经从米加托比亚出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.09,0:58:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预计明晚到达地球
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.57,0:58:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 进行引导啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.26,0:58:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明…明天晚上?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.05,0:58:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎么说也太快了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.99,0:58:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.92,0:58:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 总司令
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.85,0:58:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 为什么不回答
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.33,0:58:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的任务是在地球上建立基地
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.37,0:58:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且引导铁人兵团
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.56,0:58:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我完成任务!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.71,0:58:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.09,0:59:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是莉露露无法对铁人兵团进行引导
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.05,0:59:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们对地球情况完全不了解 肯定会混乱的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.65,0:59:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个空子就是我们的机会!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.52,0:59:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能让莉露露接近这里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.63,0:59:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然计划已经定好了 就赶紧离开这里吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.47,0:59:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.42,0:59:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.34,0:59:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.63,0:59:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.28,0:59:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.63,0:59:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露这家伙 到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.53,0:59:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总司令 跃迁的准备完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.80,0:59:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始跃迁
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.07,0:59:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标 地球!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.39,0:59:41.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.70,0:59:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.18,0:59:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.38,0:59:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.35,0:59:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.79,0:59:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.31,0:59:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在叫谁呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.77,1:00:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现地球人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.22,1:00:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.65,1:00:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.04,1:00:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好怕!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.62,1:00:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会在这里?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.49,1:00:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露! 莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.71,1:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.90,1:00:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.37,1:00:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.82,1:00:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.93,1:00:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.12,1:00:40.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露在哪?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.51,1:00:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.09,1:00:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子 叫莉露露啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.19,1:00:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.29,1:00:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露在这里?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.66,1:00:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底什么情况啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.02,1:00:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.99,1:00:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来她是机器人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.95,1:00:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤很重…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.05,1:00:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 好像是坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.78,1:01:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露是负责引导敌人的吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.71,1:01:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那把她彻底破坏掉不就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.89,1:01:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么行! 别说得这么过分啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.54,1:01:07.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说要破坏她…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.16,1:01:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.88,1:01:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们可是企图征服地球的家伙啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.70,1:01:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实没错…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.43,1:01:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 如果治好了莉露露
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.16,1:01:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定就可以问出很多关于铁人兵团的情报
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.64,1:01:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好! 治好她吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.57,1:01:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 就是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.18,1:01:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「机械急救箱」!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.37,1:01:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要把药抹上去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.51,1:01:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,断了的电线和缺失的零件都能修复
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.98,1:01:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过就是要点时间了…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.68,1:01:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到房间外面去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.05,1:01:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然是机器人 不过她也是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.26,1:01:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 你也是女孩子?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.93,1:01:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.36,1:01:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别 别耍我! 我可是男孩子!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.38,1:01:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比哟
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.65,1:01:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就出去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.55,1:01:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但…但是!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.23,1:01:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很担心莉露露吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.59,1:01:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 我一定会救她的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.37,1:02:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会救你的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.67,1:02:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要把身上的泥都抹掉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.67,1:02:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是机器人?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.77,1:02:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是没看到伤口 还真是没法相信
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.78,1:02:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为地球人的间谍 做成这样就不容易被怀疑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.49,1:02:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.06,1:02:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一说…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.68,1:02:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们走!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.79,1:02:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说走 要去哪啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.40,1:02:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级市场
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.05,1:02:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级市场?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.41,1:02:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直好想吃一整个的火腿啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.90,1:02:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最高级的肉~
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.88,1:02:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以做成美味的牛排了!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.79,1:02:49.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杯面 杯面…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.56,1:02:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杯面!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.89,1:02:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都是我的东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.32,1:02:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「再也」…「逃」…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.98,1:02:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不了啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.83,1:03:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你长得一模一样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.87,1:03:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是这样的小不点呢!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.81,1:03:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要变成更帅气的鸟比哟!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.87,1:03:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.28,1:03:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.44,1:03:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是心血来潮而已
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.05,1:03:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.41,1:03:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你还不能起来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.57,1:03:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想把我怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.14,1:03:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.50,1:03:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会好好地帮你治疗的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.88,1:03:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我? 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.20,1:03:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问为什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.62,1:04:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不管你的话 你就会死掉啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.54,1:04:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.13,1:04:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是指坏掉吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.65,1:04:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算我坏掉了 跟你又有什么关系呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.33,1:04:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关系…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.51,1:04:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又确实没有
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.51,1:04:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说太多话了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.08,1:04:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乱动的话 伤口就愈合不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.95,1:04:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…不明白…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.05,1:04:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…要救…我…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.89,1:04:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.88,1:04:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃饭啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.40,1:04:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃饭?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.14,1:04:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客气了!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.61,1:04:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.50,1:04:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美味!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.54,1:04:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.02,1:04:39.63,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}给
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.12,1:04:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是音乐
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.82,1:05:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.81,1:05:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.56,1:05:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.73,1:05:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦? 来唱歌啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.55,1:05:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 大雄!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.76,1:05:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来 我找到个很可爱的东西哦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.49,1:05:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃不下了…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.94,1:05:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 到换药的时间了 我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.66,1:05:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.31,1:05:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 皮波呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.14,1:05:54.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑哪去了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.83,1:05:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波肯定也是去了莉露露那里啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.32,1:06:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是喊着「莉露露~」这样撒着娇啦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.45,1:06:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好恶心~
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.65,1:06:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天晚上 铁人兵团就要杀来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.94,1:06:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类 还不知道铁人兵团的真正可怕之处…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.09,1:06:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我回来晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.58,1:06:26.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来给你换药吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.24,1:06:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.73,1:06:32.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤口上已经长了薄皮了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.49,1:06:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定会后悔救了我的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.50,1:06:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人兵团很快就会到来 开始狩猎地球人了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.26,1:06:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓了地球人 然后想干什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.64,1:06:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会带到米加托比亚去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.80,1:06:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们作为奴隶来劳动
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.67,1:06:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奴隶?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.94,1:06:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像人类这样的低等生物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.12,1:06:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替身为支配者的机器人劳动 不是理所当然的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.92,1:06:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是神所定下的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.20,1:07:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人可是人类制造的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.58,1:07:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的太奇怪了!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.06,1:07:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久很久以前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.57,1:07:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远在地球人出现之前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.48,1:07:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在银河的另一边 有着兴盛的人类文明
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.19,1:07:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 神抛弃了那些人类
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.28,1:07:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们任性 贪婪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.78,1:07:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相互憎恨 彼此仇杀
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.67,1:07:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神降临到无人的星球上
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.13,1:07:28.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创造出了名为「阿姆」和「伊姆」的机器人 并对它们说
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.01,1:07:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「你们要创造出像天国一样的世界」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.49,1:07:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姆和伊姆孜孜不倦地制造着机器人子孙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.34,1:07:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来人类灭亡了 而机器人文明则繁盛起来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.13,1:07:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时 在社会之中
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.41,1:07:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,支配者和被支配者出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.77,1:07:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贵族和有钱的机器人 开始使用奴隶机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.50,1:07:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是到了近代 认为机器人皆平等的看法广为传播
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.11,1:07:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于 奴隶机器人得到了解放
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.67,1:08:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是 我们打算使用人类作为新的劳动力
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.55,1:08:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吗? 机器人是神的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.48,1:08:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙也是为了机器人而存在的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.43,1:08:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直就像人类历史的重演
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.13,1:08:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神也会觉得很失望的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.81,1:08:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.04,1:08:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说机器人在模仿人类?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.91,1:08:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我把这话收回去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.93,1:08:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊 现在乱动的话伤口就…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.54,1:08:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我收回去!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.17,1:08:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌! 再也不管你了!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.58,1:08:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你就这么坏掉好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.53,1:08:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.78,1:08:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人怎么可能明白人类的感情…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.42,1:09:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别哭了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.65,1:09:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.59,1:09:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明遭受了那种对待…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.19,1:09:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.09,1:09:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把人类抓住 拿去做奴隶就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.18,1:09:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的这么想吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.08,1:09:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.32,1:10:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.14,1:10:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫裘多
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.30,1:10:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波这名字…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.89,1:10:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 莉露露
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.64,1:10:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在地球上看到的星星 非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.12,1:10:18.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟在米加托比亚上看到的星星 是一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.40,1:10:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.41,1:10:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.00,1:10:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类 真的是没用的生物吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.02,1:10:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定 人类跟我们是一样的…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.34,1:10:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.03,1:10:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…忘记自己的使命了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.27,1:10:36.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.20,1:10:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我意识到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.09,1:10:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露之所以会救我…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.60,1:10:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.75,1:10:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救你也只是心血来潮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.05,1:10:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有任何意义…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.64,1:10:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有意义…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.47,1:10:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.36,1:10:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我 莉露露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.08,1:11:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.91,1:11:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到头来还是没回来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.82,1:11:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说也没有去莉露露那里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.80,1:11:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去找皮波才行
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.54,1:11:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿点什么道具出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.03,1:11:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 也是啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.25,1:11:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「望远磁铁」!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.59,1:11:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「望远磁铁」?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.64,1:11:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个道具呢 首先在望远镜里找到要找的人或者物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.62,1:11:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后能用磁铁把它吸过来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.76,1:11:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的磁铁是北极
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.98,1:11:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 用这个望远镜来找皮波
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.75,1:11:41.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.05,1:11:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过…要在这么大的世界里面找到皮波
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.76,1:11:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直比海底捞针还难…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.29,1:11:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.40,1:11:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快扣下扳机!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.90,1:11:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比哟!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.65,1:11:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.90,1:12:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.32,1:12:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比哟!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.19,1:12:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要被拽过去了!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.23,1:12:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.55,1:12:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.73,1:12:15.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.43,1:12:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大雄!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.17,1:12:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的头…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.47,1:12:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.25,1:12:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么回事啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.43,1:12:32.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,磁力比想象中还强啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.64,1:12:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.45,1:12:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了 十个小时后效力就会消失
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.85,1:12:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.93,1:12:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比哟!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.87,1:12:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 为什么要做这么多余的事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.24,1:12:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为…我很担心你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.46,1:12:55.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.15,1:12:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…会担心我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.11,1:13:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急会议!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.37,1:13:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 皮波回来了?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.33,1:13:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那头是怎么搞的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.90,1:13:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀~ 总觉得好可爱~
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.54,1:13:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真 真没礼貌!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.82,1:13:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我来解释一下计划
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.54,1:13:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.89,1:13:18.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波 你是我们的敌人? 还是同伴?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.25,1:13:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个都不是 我是莉露露的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.41,1:13:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.71,1:13:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然她看来不是同伴…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.59,1:13:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「隔音耳贴」!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.32,1:13:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是让莉露露知道了我们的计划就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.65,1:13:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波是傻瓜!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.93,1:13:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 听不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.93,1:13:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波是小不点!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.08,1:13:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你是不是在说我坏话啊比哟!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.30,1:13:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没说 没说啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.83,1:13:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许说我是小不点!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.53,1:13:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在意啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.96,1:13:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是女孩子!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.89,1:13:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 还是很介意啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.94,1:13:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没礼貌!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.59,1:13:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 计划是?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.33,1:13:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 之前我们去过的那个大湖
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.18,1:14:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把「相反世界进入油」洒到上面 制造出一个巨大的出入口
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.21,1:14:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就从那把铁人兵团引诱到镜面世界来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.07,1:14:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把整个铁人兵团?!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.21,1:14:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这边的世界 无论被怎么破坏都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.70,1:14:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让它们跟空气战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.37,1:14:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 怎么把它们引诱进来呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.71,1:14:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波能发出收集部件的信号对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.19,1:14:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没礼貌!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.31,1:14:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就从湖那里发出信号
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.80,1:14:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.14,1:14:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 如果莉露露来妨碍就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.21,1:14:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在她情况怎样?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.77,1:14:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在不断康复呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.66,1:14:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让她把这个吞下去 就能让她睡上24个小时了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.44,1:14:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.79,1:14:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是让她睡着而已啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.04,1:14:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎和小夫就负责在城市里放哨
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.92,1:14:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.79,1:14:49.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.42,1:14:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤口都完全愈合了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.57,1:14:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不用再敷药了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.93,1:14:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的衣服 随便挑选你喜欢的穿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.11,1:14:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪件好呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.41,1:14:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪件都行
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.56,1:15:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选哪件好呢~
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.32,1:15:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露之所以会救我…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.06,1:15:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.41,1:15:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.46,1:15:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是 一点都没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.25,1:15:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 穿上这件试试
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.73,1:15:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 举手~
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.49,1:15:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己能穿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.83,1:15:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱~
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.48,1:15:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 还是不能乱动哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.85,1:15:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易愈合的伤口又会裂开的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.30,1:15:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的行为真是无法理解
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.09,1:15:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要救敌人?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.20,1:15:40.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时不时做一些没道理的事情 这才是人类啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.09,1:15:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 把这个吞下去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.11,1:15:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好休息的话 就能彻底康复了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.77,1:15:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好脏的人偶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.96,1:15:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 我总觉得它很寂寞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.98,1:15:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人偶会觉得寂寞…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.25,1:15:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又没有思想
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.90,1:16:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.69,1:16:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是个人偶 也肯定是有心的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.78,1:16:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经睡着了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.94,1:16:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 稍微睡一会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.73,1:16:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这油看着看着就散开了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.20,1:16:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底在干什么呢比哟?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.94,1:16:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管啦 别管啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.84,1:16:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.50,1:16:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦的「瞬间结合枪」 非常有效
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.84,1:16:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底它们会不会上钩呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.33,1:17:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去去城里 有些事情要做
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.77,1:17:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就看着湖吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.41,1:17:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波也留在这里哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.49,1:17:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想分开啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.16,1:17:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分…不…开…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.04,1:17:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,效…效力消失了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.61,1:17:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有生物的世界…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.74,1:17:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总觉得好可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.67,1:17:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好安静
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.62,1:17:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.05,1:17:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才…才不是!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.65,1:17:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 就是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.51,1:17:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不是! 我可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.35,1:17:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是~ 确实就是~
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.81,1:17:56.44,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}我才不是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.65,1:17:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是胆小鬼~
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.60,1:18:00.25,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}我说不是就不是啦! 真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.58,1:18:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.99,1:18:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么什么什么
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.10,1:18:05.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么东西什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.30,1:18:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是皮波你更胆小呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.38,1:18:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我只是被吓了一跳!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.13,1:18:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是胆小呢!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.71,1:18:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看就不是 明明吓得不行
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.06,1:18:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不是!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.43,1:18:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是~ 确实就是~
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.14,1:18:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波是胆小鬼~
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.67,1:18:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你要嘲笑就趁现在了!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.67,1:18:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人兵团来到之后
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.29,1:18:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一下子就会把你们打得落花流水的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.94,1:18:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是我 如果能回到原来的身体里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.24,1:18:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对付你们这种东西也就是三两下的事情!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.31,1:18:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哭了我也不管!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.14,1:18:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之…之后再向我道歉 也不会原谅你的!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.84,1:18:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.56,1:18:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想…跟皮波战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.68,1:19:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.80,1:19:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 好像没有机器人出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.76,1:19:31.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我们打倒了很多吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.84,1:19:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.17,1:19:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去超级市场买做晚饭的菜了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.47,1:19:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.91,1:19:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不想跟大雄战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.76,1:19:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想把这份想法告诉莉露露
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.83,1:19:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我呼叫她 她也不回应我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.27,1:19:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就算分开了也能对话吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.62,1:19:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.69,1:20:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在我的身体里 放进了莉露露的一部分
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.70,1:20:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 从不久前开始
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.74,1:20:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就一直把自己的心封闭起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.40,1:20:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好想把自己感受到的 也让莉露露感受一下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.47,1:20:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.79,1:20:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藏起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.92,1:20:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好多!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.82,1:20:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是地球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.00,1:20:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先破坏大城市 让地球人感到恐惧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.89,1:20:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后 就开始捕捉奴隶!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.36,1:20:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全军 进攻!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.60,1:20:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来…来来来来来…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.99,1:20:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了来了来了来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.05,1:20:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机机机…机器…机器…!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.15,1:21:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满天都是机器人啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.97,1:21:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嘛!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.95,1:21:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他们 成功地把敌人引到这个世界来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.34,1:21:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.82,1:21:09.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可贺…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.73,1:21:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.37,1:21:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.07,1:21:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人兵团向着市中心去了!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.90,1:21:18.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就猜到它们会这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.29,1:21:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人迎战了!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.57,1:21:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那个大厦!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.50,1:21:49.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人都没有? 怎么可能!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.06,1:21:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明抵抗得那么激烈
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.63,1:21:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太手软了!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.68,1:22:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到把人类吓得跑出来为止 给我彻底地破坏!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.94,1:22:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.72,1:22:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁在跟兵团战斗呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.72,1:22:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.75,1:22:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就把秘密公开吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.39,1:22:13.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「改良型回音山」!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.02,1:22:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不仅能把声音
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.85,1:22:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能把光和爆炸冲击波给反射回去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.55,1:22:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击激烈 能反射回去的攻击也会激烈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.51,1:22:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 铁人兵团在拼命地跟空气战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.75,1:22:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 这让皮波知道了不会有问题吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.77,1:22:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.90,1:22:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是我们的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.39,1:22:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只…只是大雄自己这么说罢了比哟
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.98,1:22:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.87,1:22:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.36,1:22:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露不见了!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.71,1:22:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露她?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.13,1:22:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.55,1:22:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.54,1:22:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是让莉露露把镜面世界的秘密暴露了 那就完了!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.50,1:23:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们分头去找
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.10,1:23:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.65,1:23:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然一个人类都找不到
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.53,1:23:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.87,1:23:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.01,1:23:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这个…仍然没有回答…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.15,1:23:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.90,1:23:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.10,1:23:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.12,1:23:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露! 皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.10,1:23:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露! 皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.70,1:23:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.47,1:23:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.39,1:23:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.09,1:23:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.43,1:23:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香她很担心你
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.38,1:23:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 一起回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.24,1:23:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.13,1:24:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去向总司令报告你们的诡计
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.49,1:24:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这样的话 现实世界里的人们就…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.45,1:24:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.50,1:24:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要对现实世界发起总攻 并捕捉人类
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.41,1:24:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是为此而来的!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.93,1:24:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你这么做的!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.36,1:24:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我会开枪的!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.92,1:24:17.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你开枪啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.07,1:24:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了? 开枪啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.19,1:24:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能开枪!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.60,1:24:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.07,1:24:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…裘多?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.12,1:24:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会变成这个样子?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.97,1:24:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露! 不能和人类战斗啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.39,1:24:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…打算背叛祖国吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.00,1:24:36.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 不要把心封闭起来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.95,1:24:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听听我的心声啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.16,1:24:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 其实你也应该已经明白了…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.57,1:24:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.73,1:24:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是米加托比亚的机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.26,1:24:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有着向祖国应尽的义务
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.40,1:24:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 无论如何我都得去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.71,1:24:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样! 不然我就开枪了!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.68,1:24:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我说真的!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.49,1:24:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.68,1:25:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要阻止我的话 只有开枪一个方法了!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.33,1:25:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点开枪啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.84,1:25:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪啊!!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.29,1:25:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没出息!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.11,1:25:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.94,1:25:23.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波 振作点!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.92,1:25:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.63,1:25:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总司令…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.88,1:25:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直没有联系 你至今为止到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.82,1:25:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘记任务了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.49,1:25:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.22,1:25:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为碰上了预料之外的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.81,1:25:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得到充分的机会跟地球人一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.86,1:25:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并得以深入地了解人类这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.20,1:25:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.48,1:25:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 那些地球人在哪?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.10,1:26:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然在不断战斗 却找不到对手的身影
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.60,1:26:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.60,1:26:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我 莉露露
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.41,1:26:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…不想回答
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.86,1:26:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.27,1:26:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让…让人类做奴隶…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.39,1:26:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不对的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.90,1:26:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…叛变了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.59,1:26:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叛徒!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.89,1:26:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 把你知道的都说出来!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.22,1:26:35.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类只是像垃圾一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.03,1:26:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然同情垃圾…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.66,1:26:39.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.18,1:26:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 还有静香
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.07,1:26:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都跟莉露露是一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.64,1:26:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是垃圾!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.43,1:26:52.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类 是跟我们一样的…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.01,1:26:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 有着比我们更复杂的心
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.86,1:27:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.30,1:27:00.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.30,1:27:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露她…还有皮波…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.07,1:27:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对方人数那么多 出去只会被它们抓走的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.81,1:27:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.95,1:27:08.55,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}你错了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.62,1:27:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神之所以把我们选为宇宙的支配者
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.24,1:27:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是为了代替人类 创造机器人的天国
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.92,1:27:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为不是机器人的天国
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.50,1:27:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是属于宇宙中所有居民的天国…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.87,1:27:23.60,note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\a6}住嘴!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.90,1:27:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.44,1:27:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是从什么时候开始 走上了背离神之心的道路呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.43,1:27:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙也变成垃圾了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.37,1:27:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来只能把她解体了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.32,1:27:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行刑的准备已经做好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.23,1:27:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 你还有什么遗言吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.74,1:28:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止捕捉奴隶…并撤退…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.31,1:28:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她烧到连灰都不剩!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.96,1:28:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.92,1:28:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.95,1:28:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.47,1:28:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露! 我们来救你了!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.36,1:28:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.17,1:28:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是人类!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.66,1:28:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从侧面抢过来!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.05,1:28:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打下来!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.25,1:28:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连…连裘多也背叛了我们…!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.37,1:28:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无疑问他们知道些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.91,1:28:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找他们!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.16,1:28:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把地皮翻过来也要找出来!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.62,1:28:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.53,1:28:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.00,1:28:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「机械急救箱」又派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.04,1:29:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露拼上性命 守住了镜面世界的秘密啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.37,1:29:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.66,1:29:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经是我们的同伴了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.94,1:29:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的可以相信你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.48,1:29:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别相信我…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.65,1:29:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我觉得捕捉奴隶是不对的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.56,1:29:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我还是米加托比亚的机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.96,1:29:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跟祖国战斗 我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.29,1:29:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.14,1:29:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不懂自己的心
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.48,1:29:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么不管她也不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.02,1:29:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了 找个地方把我关起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.18,1:29:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了 那就把你变小吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.22,1:29:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.60,1:29:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这乱子平息之前 就呆在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.25,1:29:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.34,1:30:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然一个人类都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.15,1:30:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙 到底…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.67,1:30:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总司令!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.17,1:30:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空中部队传来的联络 请看看这个!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.28,1:30:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.56,1:30:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟在米加托比亚观测的地形 完全相反啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.24,1:30:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是巧妙地制作出来的假世界吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.81,1:30:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.71,1:30:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你们好看!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.53,1:30:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了来了来了来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.94,1:30:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人兵团在大规模移动啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.99,1:30:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在冲着那个湖去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.45,1:30:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底暴露了啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.56,1:30:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在真正的世界被大肆破坏之前
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.09,1:30:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想点办法阻止它们!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.36,1:30:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于要战斗了是吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.29,1:30:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香你就留在莉露露身边
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.32,1:30:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是发生什么事情 就用这个「备用口袋」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.06,1:30:53.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.65,1:30:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露 我…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.34,1:30:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.62,1:30:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要小心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.95,1:31:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跟大雄一起战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.00,1:31:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想…助大雄一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.85,1:31:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 走了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.98,1:31:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.52,1:31:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「空气炮」「空气枪」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.10,1:31:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「闪躲披风」还有「瞬间结合枪」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.45,1:31:25.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑你们自己喜欢的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.43,1:31:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.53,1:31:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「改良型回音山」也全部用上
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.82,1:31:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让这边的战斗力看起来大上几十倍
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.24,1:31:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静点!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.65,1:31:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「冷静」?! 这种情况下?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.17,1:31:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大的军团开始总攻了啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.29,1:31:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论怎么想都能预见结局了啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.63,1:31:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身为男人 有时明知不行也要挺身而上!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.15,1:31:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.15,1:31:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们不做 那谁来拯救这个地球!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.96,1:32:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我们了…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.89,1:32:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.46,1:32:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们了…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.58,1:32:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.09,1:32:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来就没为人类考虑过
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.01,1:32:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总认为要是让人类做奴隶了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.16,1:32:26.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祖国的劳动机器人就能获得幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.39,1:32:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是在某个地方 走上了错误的路呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.62,1:32:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说 神在制造阿姆和伊姆的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.94,1:32:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么地方搞错了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.21,1:32:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.58,1:32:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想回去很久很久以前
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.22,1:32:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去向神抱怨一下啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.02,1:32:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向神…抱怨…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.67,1:32:47.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.42,1:32:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定你刚才的一句话 就能拯救地球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.76,1:32:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来吧 我们去见见神
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.60,1:32:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去见神?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.89,1:33:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 去见那位制造出阿姆和伊姆的科学家
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.96,1:33:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都烧光了!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.02,1:33:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像 整个地球都被烧塌了一样
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.11,1:33:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 用「相反镜子」回去真正的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.36,1:33:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.44,1:33:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢…欢迎
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.69,1:33:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赶时间 先告辞了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.56,1:33:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米加托比亚是什么时候建国的?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.88,1:33:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年举行了三万周年纪念庆典
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.12,1:33:38.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能行吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.46,1:33:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.92,1:33:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哆啦的道具是很厉害的!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.62,1:33:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观的大军
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.46,1:33:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些还不是全部
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.06,1:33:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是剩下的部队也从国外赶回来的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.83,1:33:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些家伙 就凭五个人也想战斗吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.73,1:33:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.32,1:34:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三万年前的米加托比亚?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.20,1:34:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.60,1:34:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的阿姆和伊姆的子孙居然做出这种事情…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.28,1:34:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想 博士你一定能想点办法的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.85,1:34:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是头脑内植入的竞争本能 向着坏的方向发展了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.32,1:34:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竞争本能?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.93,1:34:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是无论如何都要比别人更胜一筹的心
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.49,1:34:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家互相竞争的话 社会就能因此而发展
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.28,1:34:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 只要有一点差错
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.70,1:34:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弱者就会被践踏 只有强者能得以繁盛
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.43,1:34:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会变成一个弱肉强食的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.31,1:34:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟我所期望的天国 实在有天壤之别
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.38,1:34:48.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改造它们的头脑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.51,1:34:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士! 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.35,1:34:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所剩的时间…不多了…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.24,1:35:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,培养出会为他人着想的温暖心灵吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.42,1:35:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全军 开始攻击!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.54,1:35:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「放大灯」!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.61,1:35:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.42,1:35:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个改造
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.88,1:35:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能让三万年后的米加托比亚变成完全不同的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.59,1:35:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 那个铁人兵团呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.31,1:35:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,历史会改变
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.02,1:35:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种可怕的东西 也会消失
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.31,1:35:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.41,1:35:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露也…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.36,1:35:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…也会消失?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.26,1:35:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该说 是从一开始就不存在于这个世界上…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.73,1:35:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.65,1:35:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.93,1:35:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.03,1:35:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体已经…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.01,1:35:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.54,1:35:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请振作点 博士!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.43,1:36:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士 请你教我
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.46,1:36:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来继续
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.98,1:36:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露! 你…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.86,1:36:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得这很美妙吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.83,1:36:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然能帮忙创造真正的天国
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.97,1:36:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.66,1:36:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.60,1:36:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.01,1:36:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.70,1:37:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士 然后要怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.23,1:37:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.36,1:37:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.40,1:37:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作点!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.56,1:37:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛啊 博士!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.80,1:37:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶啊 裘多!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.23,1:37:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总…总司令?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.67,1:37:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.44,1:37:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士! 博士!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.03,1:37:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办好?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.41,1:37:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为他人着想的心…要怎样…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.50,1:37:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总司令!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.42,1:37:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把裘多彻底摧毁!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.77,1:37:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总司令!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.24,1:37:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士…我该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.70,1:37:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.55,1:37:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.85,1:38:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.20,1:38:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要把我从你们这得到的感受告诉它们的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.85,1:38:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 一定…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.09,1:38:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裘多
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.11,1:38:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我现在正准备做什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.91,1:38:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.07,1:38:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改变过去的话 你也会消失的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.90,1:38:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会犹豫的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.61,1:38:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要是为了保护大家 我…!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.39,1:38:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.38,1:38:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总司令 请看!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.66,1:39:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙 已经跟垃圾一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.73,1:39:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.66,1:39:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.23,1:39:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前进! 把他们捏碎!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.35,1:39:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.25,1:39:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.82,1:39:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.23,1:39:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 没事…的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.55,1:39:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.89,1:39:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会结束的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.47,1:39:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎? 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.36,1:39:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.36,1:39:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是增援部队
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.18,1:39:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们的胜利啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.17,1:39:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算有成千上万的被打倒了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.92,1:39:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有无数的机器人可以代替!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.85,1:39:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么会!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.93,1:39:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不行了…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.96,1:40:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.82,1:40:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.49,1:40:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底…发生什么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.18,1:40:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…到底…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.73,1:40:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽…虽然不知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.77,1:40:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.71,1:40:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.43,1:40:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为…为什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.87,1:40:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.89,1:40:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经…没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.66,1:40:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,历史改变了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.76,1:40:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人兵团也消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.58,1:41:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.20,1:41:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.56,1:41:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.53,1:41:10.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样 一定会…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.73,1:41:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米加托比亚也会…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.16,1:41:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成像地球一样 像天国一样的世界…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.87,1:41:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别消失啊 不能消失啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.49,1:41:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.25,1:41:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能遇见你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.27,1:41:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是 太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.17,1:41:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能重生的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.85,1:41:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要变成 像天使一样的机器人…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.73,1:41:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮波!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.49,1:41:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个名字…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.04,1:41:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.68,1:41:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要成为 你们的朋友哦…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.50,1:42:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.49,1:42:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你这么慢 就来找你了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.45,1:42:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又被留堂了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.62,1:42:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.46,1:42:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说我最近老是发呆
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.88,1:42:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说啊 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.43,1:42:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.74,1:42:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过了三万年 米加托比亚变成了一个怎样的星球呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.89,1:42:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.03,1:43:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是变成了一个美丽的 像天国一样的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.35,1:43:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉露露和皮波会重生吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.18,1:43:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.51,1:43:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就相信好了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.72,1:43:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 大家说要去空地玩
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.94,1:43:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄也快点过来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.88,1:43:15.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.87,1:43:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着你哦
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.85,1:43:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是重生的话
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.03,1:43:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会再来地球呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.23,1:43:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 这次就不是作为间谍吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.03,1:44:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们重生了啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.06,1:44:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是这样!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.53,1:44:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位! 喂!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.12,1:44:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.56,1:48:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位 是不是很有趣啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.12,1:48:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明年也要看哦!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.52,1:48:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2012年春上映
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.24,1:48:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬请期待!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------AimuUta-----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:16.80,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}ひとつめは愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:23.22,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}あなたと私はひとつ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:30.12,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}ふたつめに願い
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:37.59,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}あなたはあなた　私は私
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:44.85,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}みっつめに思う
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.51,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}あなたは　なぁに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:56.33,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}私は　なぁに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:16.80,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}第一颗是爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:23.22,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}你与我本是一人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:30.12,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}向第二颗许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:37.59,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}你是你 我是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:44.85,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}在第三颗思索
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.51,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}你是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:56.33,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}我又是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------OP-----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:26.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我的心中 总是总是在描绘着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:34.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,满载着梦想 只属于自己的世界地图
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:36.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:43.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞上蓝天 穿越时空 前往遥远的国度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:50.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,快点打开大门 我现在就想出发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:51.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,任意门!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:59.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,长大成人之后我们会不会忘记呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:07.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,到了那个时候再试着回想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Shalalalala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,唱起歌儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:15.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起来 手儿牵着手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:24.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样 让全世界 充满了梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------Insert 1-----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:53.79,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ネコの額みたいなちっちゃなお店
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.49,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ネコの手も借りたいと
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:14:00.30,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ネコに小判をあげました
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.54,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ネコの目　ネコの目　クルクル
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:07.28,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,寝込まないで　がんばれ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:10.13,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ネコも　しゃくしもドタバタ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:11.84,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,大さわぎ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:15.68,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ニャバダバ　ニャバダバ　ワンツースリー
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:18.57,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,はいはい　ネコなら　ニャンツースリー
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.24,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ニャバダバ　ニャバダバ　ワンツースリー
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:23.69,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,キャッと　おどろいた
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:26.83,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ニャバダバ　ニャバダバ　ワンダフル
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:29.71,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,はいはい　ネコなら　ニャンダフル
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.38,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ニャバダバ　ニャバダバ　ワンダフル
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:35.41,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,すごいねこの歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:53.79,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,像巴掌一样大的 小小店铺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.49,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,忙来忙去不可开交
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:14:00.30,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,结果还是白忙一场
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.54,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,猫的眼睛 变化无常 转呀转呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:07.28,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,不要睡着了 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:10.13,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,不论是谁都手忙脚乱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:11.84,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,一片大混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:15.68,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,喵啪嗒啪 喵啪嗒啪 一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:18.57,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 猫咪就是 喵二三
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.24,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,喵啪嗒啪 喵啪嗒啪 一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:23.69,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,喵啊 吓了一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:26.83,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,喵啪嗒啪 喵啪嗒啪 真奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:29.71,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 猫咪就是 真奇喵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.38,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,喵啪嗒啪 喵啪嗒啪 真奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:35.41,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,真神奇呢这首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------Insert 2-----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:45.27,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}飛べないものに　羽根をつけたら
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:50.63,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}世界はきっと変わるでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:59.80,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ミミズはトンボ　車はジェット
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:05.30,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いやみな人も天使になるね
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:10.70,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}届かない思いにも
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:17.13,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}つけてみたら　勇気になって
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:23.67,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}あの空へ飛んでゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:26.51,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}キミのもと
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:31.89,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}気づいてくれたらいいな
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:45.27,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}如果给无法飞翔的东西插上翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:50.63,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}世界一定会大有不同吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:59.80,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}蚯蚓会是蜻蜓 汽车会是飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:05.30,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那人类就会变成天使了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:10.70,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}无法传达到的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:17.13,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}如果也插上了翅膀 就会变成勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:23.67,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}飞向那片天空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:26.51,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}飞到你的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:31.89,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}如果你能发觉就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------Insert 3-----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.20,0:46:35.12,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}ひとつめは愛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.38,0:46:41.22,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}あなたと私はひとつ
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.89,0:46:47.08,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}ふたつめに願い
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.10,0:46:54.55,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}あなたはあなた　私は私
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.18,0:47:01.81,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}みっつめに思う
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.41,0:47:05.99,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}あなたは　なぁに
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.54,0:47:12.72,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}私は　なぁに
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.20,0:46:35.12,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}第一颗是爱
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.38,0:46:41.22,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC77E7&\be3\fad(200,200)}你与我本是一人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.89,0:46:47.08,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}向第二颗许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.10,0:46:54.55,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&HE3B679&}你是你 我是我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.18,0:47:01.81,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}在第三颗思索
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.41,0:47:05.99,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}你是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.54,0:47:12.72,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}我又是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------Insert 4-----------------
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.74,1:04:50.79,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}太陽笑う　日もあれば
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.93,1:04:54.04,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ナミダ雨降る　日もあるね
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.12,1:04:57.18,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}心が曇る　日もあれば
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.34,1:05:00.30,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}カミナリ怒る　日もあるね
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.63,1:05:03.70,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}泣いて笑って落ち込んで
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.83,1:05:07.04,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ときどき嵐になるけど
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.80,1:05:14.03,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そのどれもがボクらを近づけた
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.12,1:05:18.22,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}キミがいてくれるなら
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.28,1:05:21.80,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ボクはボクになれるよ
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.76,1:05:27.68,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}天気予報は　にほん晴れ
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.98,1:05:31.13,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}キミがいてくれるから
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.26,1:05:34.56,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何も怖くはないさ
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.70,1:05:41.82,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ふたりで明日へ　歩いて行こう
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.74,1:04:50.79,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要是有阳光灿烂的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.93,1:04:54.04,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就也有阴雨绵绵的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.12,1:04:57.18,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要是有心情阴暗的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.34,1:05:00.30,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就也有雷声阵阵的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.63,1:05:03.70,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哭着 笑着 或者心情低落
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.83,1:05:07.04,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}虽然偶尔也会有暴风雨
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.80,1:05:14.03,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但这些都将我们拉近
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.12,1:05:18.22,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只要你在我身边
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.28,1:05:21.80,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我就能做回我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.76,1:05:27.68,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}天气预报也会是朗朗晴天
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.98,1:05:31.13,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只因你在我身边
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.26,1:05:34.56,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我便无所畏惧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.70,1:05:41.82,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}两人一道 并肩走向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------Insert 4-----------------
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.61,1:43:32.90,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}みっつめに思う
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.70,1:43:36.95,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}あなたは私
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.78,1:43:43.31,Insert_jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}私はあなた
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.61,1:43:32.90,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}在第三颗思索
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.70,1:43:36.95,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}你即是我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.78,1:43:43.31,Insert_cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(200,200)\3c&H98BE7B&}我便是你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-------------------ED-----------------
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.57,1:44:24.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在你长大以前
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.99,1:44:29.83,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到许多下雨的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.29,1:44:36.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾经在某个雨天一起淋得湿透
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.17,1:44:40.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否忘记了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.30,1:44:46.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管绕了一些远路
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.81,1:44:51.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们还是成为朋友了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.31,1:44:58.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要还记得我们曾经分别
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.98,1:45:01.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就不会有问题了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.20,1:45:08.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,又空又冷的手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.70,1:45:13.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,被初次握住的那只手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.25,1:45:19.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在逐渐消逝的时间中 紧拉着奔跑
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.84,1:45:25.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不停寻找着归途
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.26,1:45:31.47,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 尽管我正在哭泣
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.77,1:45:36.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,但在你的记忆之中
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.15,1:45:42.49,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,还请让我与你绽放一样的笑颜
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.65,1:45:50.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是偶尔就好 请一定要想起我
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.79,1:46:02.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我又胆小又温柔
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.17,1:46:08.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以从来不会生气
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.51,1:46:15.06,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经在那个时候你给予我的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.06,1:46:18.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,带着颤抖的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.52,1:46:24.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在未知天空闪烁着的第一颗星
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.61,1:46:29.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,还有谜题都解开的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.66,1:46:35.83,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到了哦 非常温暖的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.16,1:46:41.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是绝不会消失的标记
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.42,1:46:47.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在我恐惧孤独 感到彷徨之时
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.18,1:46:53.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,才发觉 我的心灵深处还有光明
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.60,1:46:58.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你 一直都近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.98,1:47:03.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,无论周围是怎样的黑暗…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.57,1:47:09.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,「请不要忘记 直到我们再次重逢」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.99,1:47:14.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,「心灵的深处 一直有你存在」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.50,1:47:20.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,「在那里 你正和我一起欢笑」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.75,1:47:25.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,「我想告诉你 让你知道」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.34,1:47:31.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,「一直坚信着 一直无法见面」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.76,1:47:36.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,「我渐渐变成了大人」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.31,1:47:42.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,「尽管如此 我依然和你在一起欢笑」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.65,1:47:48.40,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,890)}「因为我们永远是朋友」
